<v Ira  Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our show by Mr. Torey Malatia, who has something he wants to say to the Sedaris family. He's been carrying this around for years. It's just been killing him.
<v Ira  Glass>WBEZ对我们节目的管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚先生负责，他有一些想对塞达里斯家族说的话。他带着这个已经好几年了。这简直快把他折磨死了。

00:56:24.530 --> 00:56:28.390
<v David Sedaris>All right, it was me. You satisfied now? That's right, me. I did it, me.
<v David Sedaris>好吧，是我。你现在满意了吗？没错，是我。我干的，是我。

00:56:28.390 --> 00:57:01.960
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
